      "Other chest pain",
      "Diarrhea",
      "Full incontinence of feces",
      "Nausea alone",
      "Dehydration",
      "Constipation, unspecified",
      "Anemia, unspecified",
      "Malignant neoplasm of trachea",
      "Mononeuritis of lower limb, unspecified",
      "Unspecified diffuse connective tissue disease",
